# murray's box: 8x A100 80GB.
# - We own GPUs 0,1,4,5,6,7. GPUs 4-7 are in exclusive-process mode.
# - GPUs 4-5 and 6-7 are NVLink pairs joined over PCIe, so keep TP=2 inside a pair
#   (TP4 across the pairs was 5x slower per step).
# - A guard kills root and docker processes on GPUs 0-3, so containers run as the calling user
#   (docker_train.py and eval_queue.py already do this).
# - Shells opened before the user joined the docker group need: sg docker -c "<cmd>".
OTA_ROOT=/data/murray/ota_sft
HARBOR_SRC=/data/murray/ota_sft/src/harbor-marin
MILES_IMAGE=miles-ota:v0.1.3-sm80
